more than a cruel hoax orchestrated by someone who had watched the show. In 2010, another blow came to the family when Mitchell was moved from a maximum security to a medium security prison. Karen's sister, Evelyn, then made the brave decision to face the man who single-handedly wiped out four members of her family. She didn't care to ask why he committed the crimes. She simply wanted him to know how much pain he'd caused. Evelyn was accompanied by two mediators armed with panic buttons in case anything went wrong, while two guards kept watch close by. Bill Mitchell nervously entered the small room with his eyes lowered. He sat just a few feet away from Evelyn, close enough that she could hear
看过节目的某人精心策划的一个残酷恶作剧。2010年，当米切尔从最高安全级别监狱转到中等安全级别监狱时，这个家庭再次遭受打击。凯伦的妹妹伊芙琳随后做出勇敢的决定，去面对那个一手毁灭她家中四口人的凶手。她不关心去问他为什么要犯罪。她只是想让他知道他带来了多少痛苦。伊芙琳由两名配备紧急按钮的调解员陪同，以防万一出现问题，同时两名警卫在附近密切注视。比尔·米切尔低着头，神情紧张地走进小房间。他坐在离伊芙琳只有几英尺远的地方，近得她能听见

